                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "e39d3201-19bb-36ef-835d-db8ffe5ed180",
                        "entry_id": "7b8f185f-9118-3f6d-80c2-9332f3ab94e3",
                        "glosses": [
                            "женск. к врач"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "024f592c-4418-402f-8f0a-22b221704323",
                                "sense_id": "e39d3201-19bb-36ef-835d-db8ffe5ed180",
                                "text": "Самая узнаваемая в мировом футболе женщина-врач Ева Карнейро отстранена от работы на матчах «Челси» после того, как главный тренер команды Жозе Моуриньо заявил, что медицинский штаб не разбирается в футболе."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "fa26330d-fe9e-40ba-bdfe-8644ac515380",
                        "source_entry_id": "7b8f185f-9118-3f6d-80c2-9332f3ab94e3",
                        "source_sense_id": "e39d3201-19bb-36ef-835d-db8ffe5ed180",
                        "target_lang_word": "physician",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "physician",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6b3d9f7f-ffda-3f2b-b9fa-a3c0715a01f4",
                                        "entry_id": "de9547eb-3441-3f3b-bca9-bede1e90913f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A practitioner of physic, i.e. a specialist in internal medicine, especially as opposed to a surgeon; a practitioner who treats with medication rather than with surgery."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "036e859e-cd36-4618-b798-9bb89848764e",
                                                "sense_id": "6b3d9f7f-ffda-3f2b-b9fa-a3c0715a01f4",
                                                "text": "His forefathers had been, as a rule, professional men—physicians and lawyers; his grandfather died under the walls of Chapultepec Castle while twisting a tourniquet for a cursing dragoon; an uncle remained indefinitely at Malvern Hill;[…]."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4d41d28e-b87d-4cc0-99d9-744d9bd1432c",
                                                "sense_id": "6b3d9f7f-ffda-3f2b-b9fa-a3c0715a01f4",
                                                "text": "In 2009, the Obama Administration released guidelines on enhanced interrogation written in 2003 and 2004 by the CIA Office of Medical Services. ^((OMS).1-3(appendix F)) The OMS guidelines, even in redacted form, and opinions from the US Department of Justice's (DOJ’s) Office of Legal Counsel show that CIA physicians, psychologists, and other health care personnel had important roles in enhanced interrogation."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "56083637-d1c4-47e7-9460-621bdae92103",
                                                "sense_id": "6b3d9f7f-ffda-3f2b-b9fa-a3c0715a01f4",
                                                "text": "The ancient Greek physician Hippocrates promoted wine for various purposes, including reducing fevers and dressing wounds."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "db648f44-2486-38fb-af78-f1993bd5749f",
                                        "entry_id": "de9547eb-3441-3f3b-bca9-bede1e90913f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A medical doctor trained in human medicine."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f6499e0a-aeae-48d3-8d23-bed7d5dacf77",
                                                "sense_id": "db648f44-2486-38fb-af78-f1993bd5749f",
                                                "text": "The doctor had to go to London for a physician to take charge of his practice[…]."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "fcf546ee-1860-45bd-817f-f0d26338b55d",
                        "source_entry_id": "7b8f185f-9118-3f6d-80c2-9332f3ab94e3",
                        "source_sense_id": "e39d3201-19bb-36ef-835d-db8ffe5ed180",
                        "target_lang_word": "Ärztin",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Ärztin",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4c7e63bf-f94f-3aa2-8d20-c6744096a0d4",
                                        "entry_id": "ee24931e-ff0f-3ebb-9449-64f97d1f562c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Heilkundige, die ein Medizinstudium abgeschlossen hat und nach Erlangung der medizinischen Approbation körperliche und seelische Krankheiten behandelt"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Beruf",
                                            "Gesundheitswesen"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fbd22190-ac45-4d86-ad83-d4c18b74d11e",
                                                "sense_id": "4c7e63bf-f94f-3aa2-8d20-c6744096a0d4",
                                                "text": "Meine Ärztin hat mir dieses Medikament empfohlen."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dd8cc088-4b8e-4939-926e-200ddfc584a5",
                                                "sense_id": "4c7e63bf-f94f-3aa2-8d20-c6744096a0d4",
                                                "text": "Samanthas Töchter sind beide Ärztinnen geworden."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "622ffc90-c9c0-48e5-975a-e098e1b8b756",
                                                "sense_id": "4c7e63bf-f94f-3aa2-8d20-c6744096a0d4",
                                                "text": "„Joyce sagt, dass sie früher Ärztin werden wollte.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7e0d3d3e-16f8-4039-9cad-dba3faeb1eb4",
                                                "sense_id": "4c7e63bf-f94f-3aa2-8d20-c6744096a0d4",
                                                "text": "„Besonders im Examen mußten sich die angehenden Ärztinnen auf alles gefaßt machen.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7ba0af31-bfdb-432d-9f45-3fda516d30fa",
                                                "sense_id": "4c7e63bf-f94f-3aa2-8d20-c6744096a0d4",
                                                "text": "„Das berufsernste Gesicht der Ärztin entspannt sich, ihre Wangen zeigen farbige Zeichen innerer Freude.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ada7d190-3c90-4c75-8038-c5896fa0b167",
                                                "sense_id": "4c7e63bf-f94f-3aa2-8d20-c6744096a0d4",
                                                "text": "„Die Ärztin sagte dies sehr entschieden und erst jetzt fiel mir auf, dass sie gar keinen Arztkittel trug.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "05b8ecb1-1af3-474d-a534-a74bc4caf751",
                        "source_entry_id": "7b8f185f-9118-3f6d-80c2-9332f3ab94e3",
                        "source_sense_id": "e39d3201-19bb-36ef-835d-db8ffe5ed180",
